OL,3,GNEWSALaw change will make more sexual
OL,4,Athreats illegal
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first of five new laws to protect
OL,7,Fwomen and girls is due to come into
OL,8,Fforce within weeks.
OL,10,FWhile it is an offence to threaten to
OL,11,Fkill, rape or cause someone serious
OL,12,Fphysical injury, from 1 December the
OL,13,Flaw in Jersey will also cover threats
OL,14,Fto commit a wider range of sexual
OL,15,Foffences.
OL,17,FThe change is one of five laws to
OL,18,Ftackle violence against women and girls
OL,19,Fadopted by the States Assembly in March
OL,20,F2026.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
