OL,3,GNEWSALaw change will make more sexual
OL,4,Athreats illegal
OL,5,
OL,6,FMinister for Justice and Home Affairs,
OL,7,Fsenator Helen Miles said: "Threats of
OL,8,Fsexual violence can cause significant
OL,9,Ffear and distress, and it is important
OL,10,Fthat Jersey's laws recognise the
OL,11,Fseriousness of this behaviour."
